= Prediction Error and Precision
== Surprise
Medulla publishes an efference copy. A one-step forward model (initially phyz)
predicts the next observation, interoceptive and exteroceptive; the residual is a
typed per-organ surprise stream. Surprise is the free-energy signal in its simplest
form, available before any world model is learned. // TBD: not built.

== Precision as global modulators
Arousal, fatigue and curiosity are latched scalar streams that set precision: how
much each error counts. Preference precision is the exploration–exploitation
dial, demonstrated on a real robot @fujii_murata — and so the temperament dial.
